{"about_the_game":"The best female pilot goes missing mid-flight. Several expeditions search for her, but expeditions continue to fail. As time passes, the incident is forgotten and ultimately ends with a crash into the sea. Ten years later, her left behind daughter comes to Kevin's office looking for her mother. The two come to a small island in the Pacific in search of her mother and encounter the island's secrets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cInteractive\u201d Puzzles</h2>Flying arrows can catch fire, and the fire spreads to the box with the fire arrow stuck in it. The fire explodes the bomb, which destroys the cheese stone.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerful Boss</h2>Survive battles against massive bosses with diverse patterns.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Boss.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cChain Action\u201d of Puzzles</h2>Player actions can create a chain reaction. If you light a barrel and throw it into a bush, the flames will spread and enemies will be hit by fire.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Fire.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interesting Dungeon Mechanics</h2>Encounter fascinating dungeon mechanics, much like riding a waterslide.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/WaterSlide.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons and Skills</h2>There are multiple weapons, and each weapon has multiple skills. Use your weapon according to the situation.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Attack.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn skills and explore hidden places</h2>There are hidden places throughout the map. Each time you learn a skill, you can explore more hidden places.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Swim.gif?t=1744598562\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2888960?t=1744598562","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744598562","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/3a767d0daf08d8cbf7d48119dca18d14df67f98f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744598562","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/3a767d0daf08d8cbf7d48119dca18d14df67f98f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744598562","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2976680,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"The best female pilot goes missing mid-flight. Several expeditions search for her, but expeditions continue to fail. As time passes, the incident is forgotten and ultimately ends with a crash into the sea. Ten years later, her left behind daughter comes to Kevin's office looking for her mother. The two come to a small island in the Pacific in search of her mother and encounter the island's secrets.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cInteractive\u201d Puzzles</h2>Flying arrows can catch fire, and the fire spreads to the box with the fire arrow stuck in it. The fire explodes the bomb, which destroys the cheese stone.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Puzzle.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Powerful Boss</h2>Survive battles against massive bosses with diverse patterns.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Boss.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u201cChain Action\u201d of Puzzles</h2>Player actions can create a chain reaction. If you light a barrel and throw it into a bush, the flames will spread and enemies will be hit by fire.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Fire.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Interesting Dungeon Mechanics</h2>Encounter fascinating dungeon mechanics, much like riding a waterslide.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/WaterSlide.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weapons and Skills</h2>There are multiple weapons, and each weapon has multiple skills. Use your weapon according to the situation.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Attack.gif?t=1744598562\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Learn skills and explore hidden places</h2>There are hidden places throughout the map. Each time you learn a skill, you can explore more hidden places.<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/extras/Swim.gif?t=1744598562\" />","developers":["Concode"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2888960/689704ad28e6bbc555fe8055d4b29df37da58932/header.jpg?t=1744598562","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Concode Corp","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 11.0 (Big Sur)+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Apple Silicon (M1)<br></li><li><st